From: Ritesh Pandit <87899750+Riteshp2001@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 16:50:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 019/140] feat(player): add resume playback pills

Add Always, Ask, and Never resume modes using the existing player-update pill UI. Ask mode keeps playback running from 00:00 and offers the saved position through an actionable pill, while automatic-resume and start-afresh feedback respect the resume indicator preference.

Behavior adapted from mpvRex.

Co-authored-by: sfsakhawat999 <75839432+sfsakhawat999@users.noreply.github.com>
